OL,3,A'He was deeply loved': Tribute to
OL,4,Aformer UK school pupil killed in
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis mother, Liudmyla, said he was
OL,8,F"funny, bright, very charismatic and
OL,9,Ffull of life" and had been an
OL,10,F"incredibly loving brother" to his
OL,11,Fyounger sisters and brother.
